      ms: 8000
      voice: gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed
    male|a||So the method estimates Early's 2014 effect against Late, which gives two, and there it stops.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 8320
      voice: gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed
    'male|a||That is the first price, in its plainest form: where no clean control exists, the method reports nothing, where the regression made a number up.':
