      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:1jpyn14'
    male|a||The other prices are assumptions, now in plain view. Parallel trends must hold for each group against its own control, not just on average.:
